            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ahora no"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminders are how Plaino keeps you on top of deadlines — turn them on in Settings to get the most out of the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒是 Plaino 帮你掌握截止日期的方式——请在“设置”中打开，以充分使用本应用。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los recordatorios son la forma en que Plaino te mantiene al día con las fechas límite; actívalos en Ajustes para aprovechar la app al máximo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plaino works by reminding you before a bill, appointment, or form is due. Turn on notifications so those reminders can actually reach you — without them, Plaino can't nudge you in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plaino 会在账单、预约或表格到期前提醒你。请打开通知，这些提醒才能及时送达——否则 Plaino 无法及时提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plaino te avisa antes de que venza una factura, cita o formulario. Activa las notificaciones para que esos recordatorios te lleguen; sin ellas, Plaino no puede avisarte a tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A job (W-2)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有工作（W-2）"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un empleo (W-2)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recent change — lost coverage, moved, married, had a baby, or job change?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近有变化吗——失去保险、搬家、结婚、生孩子或换工作？"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Un cambio reciente: perdiste cobertura, te mudaste, te casaste, tuviste un bebé o cambiaste de trabajo?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address change": {
      "localizations": {
